-- Player collision.
-- The game blocks a tile when bits 10-11 of its map grid entry (gBackupMapLayout.map) are not 0, MapGridGetCollisionAt reads
-- exactly that for walking, biking, surfing and ledges. Every frame the tiles where remote players stand (both tiles
-- while they are mid step) get the collision bit and the original value is put back as soon as they leave.
-- Nothing in the ROM is touched and the grid is rebuilt by the game on every map load.
--layout = gBackupMapLayout (Emerald, Ruby, Sapphire) / VMap (FireRed, LeafGreen): s32 width, s32 height, u16 *map. English builds only.
