-- ---- Coop: trainer flags, Mansion, objects, secret bases, gyms, badges
-- ------------------------------------------------------------------ game modes: Coop and Coop Doubles (trainer flags)
-- In these modes the "trainer defeated" flags of the paired player are shared: a trainer one of the two has beaten does not fight the
-- other one any more. The game only sets the flag after a WIN, so a lost battle changes nothing (the trainer stays for both).
-- Only the flags are shared (not gym leader events, items, story flags). It acts only when the player is paired AND the partner is on
-- the server AND both have the same game family (FireRed/LeafGreen, Emerald, Ruby/Sapphire: the trainer ids differ between them).
--   TRNR  up to 10 flag numbers (4 digits each) = trainers the sender has beaten
--   TRRQ  "send me all you have": sent when a player starts to take part (mode changed, partner arrived)
MPCoopFlags = {                       --offset of SaveBlock1.flags, first trainer flag, number of trainer flags
