-- ---- Maps and regions (Town Map, Fly map)
-- ------------------------------------------------------------------ Coop: the partner on the Town Map and the Fly map (FireRed / LeafGreen)
-- The sender works out where its player icon would be on the map of Kanto (the same steps as the game: the map section, the
-- size of the map section, the player's tile, the overrides) and sends it with PRGS. The receiver
--  * draws a second player icon (another colour) at that place while the Town Map / Fly map is open (an entry of the OAM buffer),
--  * shows "<place> <nickname>" as the name of the map section while the cursor is on it (the name pointer in the ROM table),
--  * on the Fly map lets the section of an outside partner be chosen and flies to the tile of the partner (the warp destination
--    of the game is replaced after the choice). A partner inside a building: the normal flight (the Pokemon Center of the town).
-- Kanto only (the Sevii Islands have other map pages).
